# safety net: key material never enters this repo
*.pem
*.key

/target/
node_modules/
.DS_Store

# Generated site output (design 02 §1: "sources; generated output not committed twice").
# The predecessor committed both `web/public/catalog.json` and the `web/public/v1/**` core
# projection; a build rewrites them from `catalog/` and `specs/flux/core-v1.json`, so committing
# them stores the same facts twice and makes every catalogue change a two-place diff.
/web/public/catalog.json
/web/public/v1/
/web/.vitepress/dist/
/web/.vitepress/cache/
